<title>USA: PS Group Holdings Inc sets special payout.</title>
<headline>PS Group Holdings Inc sets special payout.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PS Group Holdings Inc said Tuesday its directors approved a special cash distribution of $1.50 per common share, payable Dec 31 to shareholders of record Dec 20.</p>
</text>
